Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

You will need to change the logic here: https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/blob/master/core/src/main/java/org/renjin/parser/StringLiterals.java

Some characters should be escaped (like newlines, control characters etc) but the logic is currently way too conservative.

Best,
Alex

